              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yawe aeba Aroni ati, “Kabiye uye ukumanye Mose mu matololo.” Nao Aroni aima aya mukumanya pa lupili lwakwa Lesa, amutomona pakumuposha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
